@* What to correct in a control, under it: in the color of the text, the border of the control, in the alert color, and the
   icon pointing to the error (visuel/saisie-album/contenu.md). Written once, for every control that presents one (a field,
   the tags of the records an entry form cites). *@
<p class="field-error" id="@Id"><Icon Name="IconName.Alert" />@Text</p>

@code {
    /// <summary>The identifier the control is described by.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Id { get; set; } = null!;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Text { get; set; } = null!;
}
